{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Civics Scribble</i> is a  line drawing game with a trivia twist. Use your physics, civics, and construction skills to navigate tricky puzzles and test your civics knowledge.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>DRAW YOUR WAY THROUGH OVER 100 UNIQUE LEVELS</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Using the power of the almighty pencil, draw paths to build momentum, avoid danger, and guide Mr. Apple to the correct barrel.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3793300/extras/95ee26d6e76945650cc55f1ad76540a6.poster.avif?t=1772204998\" aria-label=\"A player drawing a line and then the apple riding atop the line, getting boosted by wind, and flying offscreen to the left.\" width=426 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3793300/extras/95ee26d6e76945650cc55f1ad76540a6.webm?t=1772204998\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3793300/extras/95ee26d6e76945650cc55f1ad76540a6.mp4?t=1772204998\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>EDIT IN-GAME LEVELS WITH CONSTRUCTION MODE</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In exchange for stars, Mr. Apple will let you bypass a tricky level by editing it any way you want. Remove pesky blocks, add in a speed boost, or even bulldoze the entire level. Just remember to wear your hard hat!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3793300/extras/5ed94efdde4b7a8a38677552d3348280.poster.avif?t=1772204998\" aria-label=\"On a difficult level, the player enters Construction Mode to remove the problematic blocks.\" width=426 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3793300/extras/5ed94efdde4b7a8a38677552d3348280.webm?t=1772204998\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3793300/extras/5ed94efdde4b7a8a38677552d3348280.mp4?t=1772204998\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>CUSTOMIZE YOUR APPEARANCE BY HELPING FAMILIAR FACES</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlock fun hats and outfits by teaming up with Mr. Apple\u2019s cousins to solve special double-apple levels! Take home a souvenir as a reminder of good times spent with good apples.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3793300/extras/c352acdf15f816d3c57d1daad6667586.poster.avif?t=1772204998\" aria-label=\"There are two apples on this level and they fall, curve, and end up bouncing off each other.\" width=426 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3793300/extras/c352acdf15f816d3c57d1daad6667586.webm?t=1772204998\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3793300/extras/c352acdf15f816d3c57d1daad6667586.mp4?t=1772204998\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>GAME FEATURES:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Follow Mr. Apple on his road trip to visit nine National and State parks across the United States and meet colorful characters at every stop.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Test your knowledge of U.S. civics and read some fun facts about history, geography, popular culture, and more!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Edit levels within the game or create your own!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Interact with and use a wide variety of effectors, including triggers, teleporters, and launchers.</p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3793300?t=1772204998","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3793300/c18cb26b686b8d613475ac776be270f499f4718c/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1772204998","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3793300/5f7121bc9ea347e64409e1b5f8481fe37cbcd96f/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1772204998","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3793300/5f7121bc9ea347e64409e1b5f8481fe37cbcd96f/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1772204998","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Camera Comfort","id":67},{"description":"Color Alternatives","id":66},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Narrated Game Menus","id":71},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"demos":[{"appid":4225730,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Civics Scribble</i> is a  line drawing game with a trivia twist. Use your physics, civics, and construction skills to navigate tricky puzzles and test your civics knowledge.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>DRAW YOUR WAY THROUGH OVER 100 UNIQUE LEVELS</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Using the power of the almighty pencil, draw paths to build momentum, avoid danger, and guide Mr. Apple to the correct barrel.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3793300/extras/95ee26d6e76945650cc55f1ad76540a6.