a reminder of good times spent with good apples.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3793300/extras/c352acdf15f816d3c57d1daad6667586.poster.avif?t=1772204998\" aria-label=\"There are two apples on this level and they fall, curve, and end up bouncing off each other.\" width=426 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3793300/extras/c352acdf15f816d3c57d1daad6667586.webm?t=1772204998\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3793300/extras/c352acdf15f816d3c57d1daad6667586.mp4?t=1772204998\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>GAME FEATURES:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Follow Mr. Apple on his road trip to visit nine National and State parks across the United States and meet colorful characters at every stop.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Test your knowledge of U.S. civics and read some fun facts about history, geography, popular culture, and more!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Edit levels within the game or create your own!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Interact with and use a wide variety of effectors, including triggers, teleporters, and launchers.</p></li></ul>","developers":["Nebraska Public Media"],"genres":[{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Free To Play","id":"37"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3793300/985481e477c1e83c3b53333c7a6ab19afa7da5b3/header.jpg?t=1772204998","is_free":true,"legal_notice":"Messy_StickyMudNStuff.mp3 by HerbertBoland -- https://freesound.org/s/104677/ -- License: Attribution 4.0<br />\r\nDoor-ThudWhamWhack by Hitrison -- https://freesound