es to roll, bounce, and teleport through 9 unique worlds. Solve tricky puzzles, get to know Mr. Apple\u2019s quirky cousins, and learn something new about civics. Feeling creative? Use Construction Mode to bulldoze or build a new path.","steam_appid":3793300,"support_info":{"email":"labs@nebraskapublicmedia.org","url":"https://nebraskapublicmedia.org/en/nebraska-public-media-labs/civics-scribble/"},"supported_languages":"English","type":"game","website":"https://nebraskapublicmedia.org/en/nebraska-public-media-labs/civics-scribble/"}